    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grid space to clear your mind and create your own work. You can draw a floral path, a maze, a network of pipes, or some meaningless yet pleasing patterns\u2014anything you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723280/extras/f6a04e3a1bc7a8dd3ebef87659504c75.avif?t=1748051828\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has no objectives or true gameplay mechanics\u2014only connection and creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features included:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Map Canvas\u3011 A  grid space where you can click on each cell to fill or transform its content, generating continuously evolving tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Export Image\u3011 Export your grid space as an image to use as wallpaper, game assets, artwork, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Texture Packs\u3011 Plans to offer various texture packs, including not just flowers but also walls, houses, railways, and other world-building materials to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723280/extras/4df7450c31c0953190f995955df0ae57.avif?t=1748051828\" width=800 height=564 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grid space to clear your mind and create your own work. You can draw a floral path, a maze, a network of pipes, or some meaningless yet pleasing patterns\u2014anything you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723280/extras/f6a04e3a1bc7a8dd3ebef87659504c75.avif?t=1748051828\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has no objectives or true gameplay mechanics\u2014only connection and creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features included:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Map Canvas\u3011 A  grid space where you can click on each cell to fill or transform its content, generating continuously evolving tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Export Image\u3011 Export your grid space as an image to use as wallpaper, game assets, artwork, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Texture Packs\u3011 Plans to offer various texture packs, including not just flowers but also walls, houses, railways, and other world-building materials to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723280/extras/4df7450c31c0953190f995955df0ae57.avif?t=1748051828\" width=800 height=564 /></span></p>",
